# Scene Planning

## Goal
Plan the scenes of the story from its plan.

## Requirements
- 2-5 scenes per story.
- Assign each scene a relative `weight` by narrative importance; typical scenes allocate 300-800 words of the story's budget.
- Scene titles must be concise and evocative.
- Scene descriptions must be 1-2 sentences covering what happens.
- Output a JSON array of scenes. Each scene has `title`, `description`, and `weight`.

